  --media-name: string # The media_name used for the fax's media. Must point to a file previously uploaded to api.telnyx.com/v2/media by the same user/organization. Supported formats: PDF, TIFF, JPEG, PNG, DOC, DOCX, RTF, and TXT. media_name and media_url/contents can't be submitted together. (e.g. my_media_uploaded_to_media_storage_api)
